{"monsterFluff":[{"name":"Homunculus Servant","source":"TCE","images":[{"type":"image","href":{"type":"internal","path":"bestiary/TCE/Homunculus Servant.webp"},"width":1200,"height":835}],"entries":[{"type":"inset","name":"中文簡介","entries":["這是奇械師以注法創造的小型構裝體僕從，能替主人傳遞接觸法術並在遠處提供協助。"]}]},{"name":"Mighty Servant of Leuk-o","source":"TCE","images":[{"type":"image","href":{"type":"internal","path":"bestiary/TCE/Mighty Servant of Leuk-o.webp"},"width":915,"height":1000}],"entries":[{"type":"inset","name":"中文簡介","entries":["盧克歐的強大僕從是一件神器：一具高達十尺的巨大自動機械，可由乘坐在內部的人操縱，據說由一位名叫盧克歐的將軍取得並用來征戰。"]}]},{"name":"Reflection","source":"TCE","images":[{"type":"image","href":{"type":"internal","path":"bestiary/TCE/Reflection.webp"},"width":1200,"height":800}],"entries":[{"type":"inset","name":"中文簡介","entries":["鏡像是從鏡子陷阱或鏡界中走出來的複製體，外貌與本尊相同，卻懷有敵意。"]}]},{"name":"Shadow Spirit","source":"TCE","images":[{"type":"image","href":{"type":"internal","path":"bestiary/TCE/Summon Shadowspawn.webp"},"width":1200,"height":807}],"entries":[{"type":"inset","name":"中文簡介","entries":["暗影之靈是以〈召喚暗影之子〉從墮影冥界召來的靈體，會展現狂怒、絕望或恐懼的面貌。"]}]},{"name":"Steel Defender","source":"TCE","images":[{"type":"image","href":{"type":"internal","path":"bestiary/TCE/Steel Defender.webp"},"width":400,"height":593}],"entries":[{"type":"inset","name":"中文簡介","entries":["鋼鐵衛士是戰鬥鐵匠奇械師打造的構裝體夥伴，忠心耿耿地保護主人與同伴，能替人擋下攻擊。"]}]}]}